      "text": "After crossing Mu Bei Mountain and then Shuang Jiang mountain, the next place is Xue Lei Mountain. Xue Lei mountain has Zhao Clan and is not treated as a wild area, because humans live there. Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing are wanted by Bai Clan, so the four do not go to Zhao Clan and press on through further mountains.",
